---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Ferrite"
description: "Ferrite is new firmware for the Radtel RT-950 Pro, written from scratch. Free, with its source public."
chapters:
  - id: slots
    title: "Three slots, one radio"
    text: "Talk on the slot in front while the other two keep listening. SLOT brings the next one forward."
  - id: scope
    title: "The band scope"
    text: "Hold 1 to see what's on the air around you. The knob moves the marker, and the strongest signal is named below."
  - id: aprs
    title: "APRS on slot C"
    text: "Slot C decodes APRS in the background while A and B stay yours for voice. Its card shows who was heard, how far away, and new messages."
  - id: crossband
    title: "Crossband repeater"
    text: "What's heard on one band goes out on the other, and back. Who's passing, the timeout and the last 30 minutes, live."
  - id: hf
    title: "Shortwave"
    text: "The broadcast receiver also tunes shortwave and the HF bands, in AM, on its own screen."
  - id: lowpower
    title: "Low Power Mode"
    text: "One switch keeps only what you need to talk on one frequency. Hold SIDE1 and SIDE2 to get everything back."
---
<script>document.documentElement.classList.add("js")</script>
<section class="story wrap">
  <div class="story-screen" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="screen story-frame">
      <img class="layer on" data-ch="hero" src="/img/home.webp" alt="" width="480" height="640">
      {%- for c in chapters %}
      <video class="layer" data-ch="{{ c.id }}" data-src="/loops/{{ c.id }}.mp4" poster="/loops/{{ c.id }}.webp" muted playsinline loop preload="none" width="960" height="1280"></video>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="story-text">
    <header class="chapter hero-copy" data-ch="hero">
      <h1>Ferrite</h1>
      <p class="lead">Free firmware for the <a href="{{ site.radio }}" rel="sponsored">Radtel RT-950 Pro</a>,
        written from scratch, with its source public.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn solid" href="/features/">See what it does</a>
        <a class="btn" href="/download/">Download</a>
      </div>
    </header>
    {%- for c in chapters %}
    <section class="chapter" data-ch="{{ c.id }}">
      <img class="ch-poster" src="/loops/{{ c.id }}.webp" alt="" width="240" height="320" loading="lazy">
      <h2>{{ c.title }}</h2>
      <p>{{ c.text }}</p>
    </section>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap closing">
  <h2>Take your firmware out of the <span class="nowrap">iron age.</span></h2>
  <div class="actions">
    <a class="btn solid" href="/features/">See what it does</a>
    <a class="btn" href="/download/">Download</a>
  </div>
  <p class="closing-more"><a href="/watch/">Or watch it in action</a></p>
</section>
<script src="/assets/home.js" defer></script>
